Recommends: agelanserver-companion-bin
Provides: agelanserver
Description: LAN server and launcher for Age of Empires II/III: DE and AoM: Retold
 luskaner's ageLANServer: a LAN replacement for the online services of Age of
 Empires II/III: Definitive Edition and Age of Mythology: Retold. The launcher
 runs from the read-only install with per-run configs generated by agelan; an
 optional agelanserver@<game>.service hosts a server without root.
